date-released: "2026-06-03"
version: "2.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/131ymm-commits/UAF-Unified-Adaptive-Framework"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  UAF is a research framework proposing that stable systems at all scales
  persist by minimizing variational free energy. It provides a formal
  ontology connecting physics, biology, cognition, social systems, and
  the noosphere through the invariant operation of prediction-error minimization.
